<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="skill">stealth</ansi> (skill)

The <ansi fg="skill">stealth</ansi> skill covers moving and acting without being noticed.

<ansi fg="yellow">Commands unlocked by this skill:</ansi>

<ansi fg="skill">(Lvl 1) sneak</ansi>
  Enter a hidden state. While hidden you are harder to detect and cannot be
  directly targeted. You can only sneak in calm rooms and cannot be in combat.
  Moving while hidden may break your cover depending on the situation.

<ansi fg="skill">(Lvl 2) pickpocket</ansi>
  Attempt to steal an item from another character's inventory without being
  noticed. Success depends on your Perception vs. their Perception.

<ansi fg="yellow">Notes:</ansi>

  Stealth skill improves through use. Each successful sneak or pickpocket
  attempt contributes to your progression.

